info.problem_statement:
Floer homology is a powerful tool for studying symplectic geometry and low-dimensional topology.
\begin{itemize}
    \item Please name three distinct Floer homology theories that play important roles in low-dimensional topology.
    \item For each theory, provide an example of a significant topological application. Your applications should not mention explicitly the Floer homology theory in the statement.
\end{itemize}

